# Title: Process Memory Dump Via Comsvcs.DLL
# ID: 646ea171-dded-4578-8a4d-65e9822892e3
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Modexp, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2020-02-18
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, car.2013-05-009
# Description: Detects a process memory dump via "comsvcs.dll" using rundll32, covering multiple different techniques (ordinal, minidump function, etc.)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((Image="*\\rundll32.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "RUNDLL32.EXE") OR (CommandLine CONTAIN "rundll32")) AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "comsvcs" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "full") AND (CommandLine CONTAIN "#-" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "#+" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "#24" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "24 " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "MiniDump" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "#65560"))) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "24" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "comsvcs" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "full") AND (CommandLine CONTAIN " #" OR CommandLine CONTAIN ",#" OR CommandLine CONTAIN ", #" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\"#")))
